# Ecomerce monorepo rules

Repo layout (do not merge FE apps into one SPA):

- `web/` — React user storefront → `ecomerce.nvnhan0810.com`
- `merchant/` — Vue merchant → `ecomerce-merchant.nvnhan0810.com`
- `admin/` — Vue admin → `ecomerce-admin.nvnhan0810.com`
- `api/` — Go API → `ecomerce-api.nvnhan0810.com`

Follow global Cursor standards:

- Frontend Clean Architecture (`modules/<feature>/{domain,application,infrastructure,presentation}`)
- Backend DDD + CQRS with the same module layout
- No business logic in React/Vue components or Go HTTP handlers
- No `any` in TypeScript; keep `strict: true`
- Add/update tests with every feature change
